/F1 12 Tf
(1. Brand Mission and Product Portfolio) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
T*
(Nexa Mobile designs smartphones built for sustained performance, battery endurance,) Tj
T*
(and intuitive software experiences for Indian and global consumers.) Tj
T*
(The 2026 lineup introduces three distinct models engineered for diverse user needs:) Tj
T*
(- Nexa One: The balanced everyday flagship. Features a 6.5-inch FHD+ AMOLED 90Hz display,) Tj
T*
(  50MP Sony OIS main camera, 5000mAh battery, 33W Fast Charging, and 8GB RAM + 128GB storage.) Tj
T*
(  Official Price: Rs. 24,999 on Amazon India.) Tj
T*
(- Nexa One Pro: Engineered for power users and creators. Features a 6.7-inch Quad HD+ AMOLED) Tj
T*
(  120Hz dynamic refresh display, 50MP Sony flagship sensor with Night Mode 3.0, 5000mAh cell,) Tj
T*
(  67W Turbo Charge, and 12GB LPDDR5 RAM + 256GB UFS 3.1 storage. Price: Rs. 39,999.) Tj
T*
(- Nexa Lite: Essential reliability. Features a 6.5-inch 90Hz display, 50MP AI dual camera,) Tj
T*
(  5000mAh battery, 18W charging, and 6GB RAM + 128GB storage. Price: Rs. 14,999.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F1 12 Tf
(2. Standard In-The-Box Contents and Eco Policy) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
T*
(Every retail box contains: Handset with pre-applied screen protector, 1-meter USB-C to USB-C cable,) Tj
T*
(SIM tray ejector tool, Quick Start Guide, and Safety Warranty Card.) Tj
T*
(Important Eco Notice: In alignment with electronic waste reduction initiatives, dedicated wall) Tj
T*
(chargers are sold separately. We recommend official Nexa 33W or 67W USB-PD power adapters.) Tj
T*
() Tj
