50 730 Td
(NEXA MOBILE - CONNECTIVITY AND SYSTEM PERFORMANCE) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
T*
() Tj
T*
/F1 12 Tf
(7. 5G Dual SIM Setup and Network Troubleshooting) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
T*
(All Nexa devices support Dual SIM Dual Standby DSDV on sub-6GHz 5G bands n28, n77, n78.) Tj
T*
(If cellular data or mobile reception drops:) Tj
T*
(1. Toggle Airplane Mode on for 10 seconds, then toggle off to re-register with cell towers.) Tj
T*
(2. Verify carrier APN settings under Settings > Network and Internet > SIMs > Access Point Names.) Tj
T*
(3. Eject the SIM tray using the bundled pin, inspect contacts for scratches, and re-seat firmly.) Tj
T*
(4. Test the SIM in another phone to rule out carrier-level network outages or deactivated accounts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F1 12 Tf
(8. System Performance, Safe Mode, and Data Backup) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
T*
(To resolve system sluggishness or app freezing:) Tj
T*
(- Keep at least 15 percent free internal storage under Settings > Storage.) Tj
T*
(- Test in Safe Mode: Press and hold Power button, then touch and hold Power Off on screen until) Tj
T*
(  'Reboot to safe mode' appears. Safe mode disables third-party apps to isolate issues.) Tj
T*
(- Always back up photos, contacts, and WhatsApp data to Google Drive before system maintenance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
